  <com>option objcsdk decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/objc_sdk_varargs</com>
  <com>clear architecture</com>
  <com>load file decompiler/crates/kuna-analysis/tests/fixtures/macho_objc_sdk_varargs_arm64</com>
  <com>option objc on</com>
